Cpntents
---------

The Golden Rule is
************************************************************************
*        Since LBLRTM only runs using TAPE5,TAPE6,TAPE11,TAPE12        *
*  you CANNOT CANNOT have more than one job running on same processor  *
*  at the same time, else they will start overwriting each other.      *
************************************************************************

******************************************************************************************************************************************************************
*  NOTE :      compare_kcompressed_vs_run8_vs_lblrtm.m   calls   driver_runXtopts_nosavegasN_onelay.m   which calls   driver_glab_lblrtm_forn_ONELAY_noN2con.m   *
*  JUST LIKE : clust_runXtopts_savegasN_file.m           calls                                                        driver_glab_lblrtm_forn_MANYLAY_noN2con    *
*  else if you call driver_glab_lblrtm_forn_ONELAY.m it will keep the N2/O2 continuum and that meses up comparisons to kCompressed cacls!!!!!                    *
******************************************************************************************************************************************************************

but when the cluster is as messed up you can start up 5 different matlab jobs on
our machine (c24-52) and then on each matlab session individdually run
processor 1 --> for JOBB = 01 : 04; clust_runXtopts_savegasN_file;   end   %% 4 jobs for CO2
processor 2 --> for JOBB = 05 : 08; clust_runXtopts_savegasN_file_2; end   %% 4 jobs for CO2
processor 3 --> for JOBB = 09 : 12; clust_runXtopts_savegasN_file_3; end   %% 4 jobs for CO2
processor 4 --> for JOBB = 13 : 17; clust_runXtopts_savegasN_file_4; end   %% 5 jobs for CH4
processor 5 --> for JOBB = 18 : 22; clust_runXtopts_savegasN_file_5; end   %% 4 jobs for CH4

1) Basics
2) file_parallelprocess_gas_2_6.txt
3) freq_boundaries.m freq_boundariesLBL.m
4) files clust_runXtopts_mkgNvfiles,clust_runXtopts_mkgWVvfiles
5) clust_runXtopts_savegasN_file.m
6) Cluster jobs and checking output
7) Cat the chunks together (11 Toffsets), then compress and convert to binary

